dependencies.design:
Read guard/current all18 metadata package roots and the embedded isolated Cargo oracle. The LIFO traversal discards dep?/sub if no edge is active; activate() never replays it. Retain weak forwarding obligations or compute a finite fixed point so activating the matching optional dependency later forwards its requested feature. Resolve aliases using existing edge keys; never turn an inactive weak reference into a strong dependency activation. Preserve per-entry identity for repeated normal/build and target-conditioned edges, each edge defaults/default-features=false and explicit features. Preserve dev-edge exclusion, per-package roots, missing-shipped failure, deterministic output and finite cycle termination. Do not collapse by package alone or swallow repeated entries. Extend the two existing adequate CLI behavior fixtures using subcases/table data; no new test declaration/species/file. Preserve all other assertions. Re-run isolated actual Cargo resolve as an oracle, not a new permanent source-scan test.

Trust boundary: Build metadata → required default-build dev-mode exclusion verdict for released tze_hud_app and all17 shippable workspace package closures. Test/dev-only features are permitted and must not contaminate shipping verdicts.

Failure/concurrency/replay matrix:
[
  {
    "case": "alias rt optional, default=[activate,forward] and reversed; activate=[dep:rt], forward=[rt?/dev-mode]",
    "expected": "Cargo oracle dev-mode and guardexit1 both; ordering irrelevant"
  },
  {
    "case": "inactive optional weak alias without any activation",
    "expected": "No activation, no forwarded feature, guardexit0"
  },
  {
    "case": "activation through intermediate feature or repeated/cyclic feature paths",
    "expected": "Obligation replay reaches same fixed point, terminates, deterministic verdict"
  },
  {
    "case": "multiple normal/build and target edges to same aliased target, different defaults/features",
    "expected": "Preserve each activated edge contribution; dev-only edge remains excluded"
  },
  {
    "case": "clean real metadata/outside-app package/missing shipped package",
    "expected": "Clean17default roots pass; outside-app leak and missing-app fail as existing fixtures pin"
  },
  {
    "case": "process concurrency/retry/cancel",
    "expected": "Pure invocation-local metadata evaluation: no new global state/cache/lock; replay same metadata gives same verdict; stdin/JSON errors retain existing behavior"
  }
]

